    "updated_at": "2024-11-14T10:35:31Z",
    "body": "Well the problem here is that value contains a string, right? Not a state. So we need a convenient way to translate a string into its state. The reference to the attribute helps with that, but it's rather vague.\r\n\r\n@domenic any quick thoughts?",
